WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:13.790
Nina was sad.

2
00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:16.914
She didn't like the last day of school.

3
00:00:16.915 --> 00:00:25.982
It meant she wouldn't see her friends for two months.

4
00:00:25.983 --> 00:00:29.503
"I wonder what we'll do today," Ethan said to Nina.

5
00:00:29.504 --> 00:00:32.279
They were walking to Kids Central.

6
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.587
"Yeah," Bobby said, joining them.

7
00:00:35.588 --> 00:00:40.539
"It'll be my last day of Kids Central. Ever."

8
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.457
"What do you mean?" Nina asked, surprised.

9
00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:49.042
"In the fall I'm joining the Sunny Dale boys' soccer team.

10
00:00:49.043 --> 00:00:52.876
I'll have practice after school," Bobby said.

11
00:00:52.877 --> 00:00:57.573
"No more Four Square or hopscotch for me."

12
00:00:57.574 --> 00:01:02.215
He laughed, but Nina thought he looked sad.

13
00:01:02.216 --> 00:01:06.864
Miss Shelly laid a huge piece of paper on the gym floor.

14
00:01:06.865 --> 00:01:11.496
"Today we're going to make a special mural," she said.

15
00:01:11.497 --> 00:01:15.030
"What's special about it?" Jason asked.

16
00:01:15.031 --> 00:01:17.387
"You won't just make it.

17
00:01:17.388 --> 00:01:21.218
You'll be in it," Miss Shelly said.

18
00:01:21.219 --> 00:01:24.411
"In it?" Izzie asked.

19
00:01:24.412 --> 00:01:27.700
"You're going to lie down on the paper.

20
00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:32.926
A partner will trace your body with a marker.

21
00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:40.401
Then we'll cut clothes from old cloth to glue on top.

22
00:01:40.402 --> 00:01:45.483
We even have yarn to make your hair!"

23
00:01:45.484 --> 00:01:49.506
Miss Shelly smiled.

24
00:01:49.508 --> 00:01:54.136
"Will you be my partner?" Nina quickly asked Izzie.

25
00:01:54.137 --> 00:01:57.219
"Of course," Izzie said.

26
00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.291
"We're going to work together,"

27
00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:02.761
Bobby said, pointing to Jason and Ethan.

28
00:02:02.762 --> 00:02:05.367
Nina took off her shoes.

29
00:02:05.368 --> 00:02:07.765
She lay down on the paper.

30
00:02:07.766 --> 00:02:10.298
"Trace me!" she said.

31
00:02:10.299 --> 00:02:14.155
Izzie started to trace around Nina's legs and arms.

32
00:02:14.156 --> 00:02:17.811
"Ha-ha! That tickles!"

33
00:02:17.812 --> 00:02:22.321
When Izzie was finished, Nina looked at her outline.

34
00:02:22.322 --> 00:02:25.831
"Wow. I'm that big?"

35
00:02:25.832 --> 00:02:30.065
"My turn," Izzie said.

36
00:02:30.066 --> 00:02:32.945
This time Nina traced Izzie.

37
00:02:32.946 --> 00:02:36.187
Then the girls looked through the piles of cloth.

38
00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:38.750
They had to choose their outfits.

39
00:02:38.751 --> 00:02:41.390
"Ooh, this is pretty."

40
00:02:41.391 --> 00:02:45.435
Nina held up some flower print cloth.

41
00:02:45.436 --> 00:02:47.503
"I'll make this my shirt."

42
00:02:47.504 --> 00:02:50.896
Izzie held up some polka-dot cloth.

43
00:02:50.897 --> 00:02:54.075
They laid the cloth on their outlines.

44
00:02:54.076 --> 00:02:56.643
They measured how much they needed.

45
00:02:56.644 --> 00:03:00.406
Both girls chose blue cloth to make jeans.

46
00:03:00.407 --> 00:03:05.173
The boys were choosing yarn for their hair.

47
00:03:05.174 --> 00:03:08.858
"Here, Izzie, this looks like your hair!"

48
00:03:08.859 --> 00:03:11.992
Ethan held up a ball of yellow yarn.

49
00:03:11.993 --> 00:03:16.645
"Nina, here's one for you. Catch!"

50
00:03:16.646 --> 00:03:20.236
Bobby tossed her a ball of black yarn.

51
00:03:20.237 --> 00:03:26.266
The girls drew their faces and glued yarn hair onto their outlines.

52
00:03:26.267 --> 00:03:35.249
In the mural all the kids were smiling and holding hands.

53
00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:39.774
"I won't be in Kids Central next year," Jason said suddenly.

54
00:03:39.775 --> 00:03:43.008
"My dad is going to work from home."

55
00:03:43.009 --> 00:03:46.800
"You too?" Nina couldn't believe it.

56
00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:50.294
Today was turning into a very sad day.

57
00:03:50.295 --> 00:03:52.629
"I'll miss Kids Central.

58
00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:59.816
But it'll be fun to help my dad cook dinner!" Jason went on.

59
00:03:59.817 --> 00:04:03.369
"We'll miss you too," Miss Shelly said.

60
00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:06.031
"What about you girls?"

61
00:04:06.032 --> 00:04:09.697
Izzie shrugged. "I don't know yet.

62
00:04:09.698 --> 00:04:12.131
But I hope I'll be here!"

63
00:04:12.132 --> 00:04:16.853
"I like Kids Central," Nina said a little loudly.

64
00:04:16.854 --> 00:04:20.624
"I want to come back next year!"

65
00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:22.798
Miss Shelly laughed.

66
00:04:22.799 --> 00:04:25.140
"I'm glad to hear that!

67
00:04:25.141 --> 00:04:33.871
Now let's hang this mural in the hall."

68
00:04:33.872 --> 00:04:39.119
"Next year Kids Central will be totally different," Nina thought.

69
00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:50.334
"But I'll always remember this year as the best year ever!"
